#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:47
#: ff23241c9c324a3e9f9eaff484592e8e
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:48
#: 0e2191ab2961455699aefea0ff126ddc
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default on  SERIAL1. It supports all serial RC "
"protocols except PPM and SBUS. For SBUS use SERIAL2, set its protocol to "
"RCIN (\"23\") and change :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` to "
"something other than RCIN (\"23\")."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入默认配置在 SERIAL1 上。支持除 PPM 和 SBUS 以外的所有串行 RC 协议。使用 SBUS 时，使用 "
"SERIAL2，将其协议设置为 RCIN（「23」），并将 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 更改为非"
" RCIN（「23」）的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:50
#: bb60a63ea3734165a62082a960f30678
msgid ""
"If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the SERIAL1 TX pin, "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` set to 3, and "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` must be set to 7 (invert TX/RX, half"
" duplex)."
msgstr ""
"若接收机为 FPort，必须将接收机连接到 SERIAL1 TX 引脚，:ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 设置为 3，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为 7（TX/RX 反相，半双工）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:51
#: 262afa68a14849318aa281faf76dedab
msgid ""
"For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use both RX1 and TX1 and set "
":ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` also to 3."
msgstr ""
"对于 CRSF/ELRS 等全双工协议，同时使用 RX1 和 TX1，并将 :ref:`RSSI_TYPE<RSSI_TYPE>` 也设置为 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:54
#: 56fd4f94f6ff4f149351e36392cf92e9
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:55
#: 4dbb50ae70ad4d0098ad148ce8d82802
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using an unused UART, such as the TX4 pin "
"(UART4 transmit). You need to set the following parameters to enable support"
" for FrSky S.PORT:"
msgstr ""
"FrSky 数传通过未使用的 UART 支持，如 TX4 引脚（UART4 发送）。需要设置以下参数以启用 FrSky S.PORT 支持："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:59
#: 17c818943e2548d5b1496e0e4f1f983f
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:60
#: 4d0db0af69404f3b81d3f698bc6a01d0
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` = 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` = 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:63
#: e5ea05890d08430180ec90fe99021de9
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:64
#: 1aa611ec3bf94375a871bc9588110209
msgid ""
"The TBS LUCID PRO supports OSD using the integrated OSD chip (MAX7456 "
"driver) and simultaneously DisplayPort using TX3/RX3 on the HD VTX "
"connector."
msgstr ""
"TBS LUCID PRO 支持使用集成 OSD 芯片（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD，同时通过高清 VTX 连接器上的 TX3/RX3 支持 "
"DisplayPort。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:67
#: ad5521e6ea8c493a88446219c8044d29
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:68
#: 51a1d999ad1b4a999ab3574a2fe4a7cc
msgid ""
"The TBS LUCID PRO supports up to 6 PWM or DShot outputs. The pads for motor "
"output M1 to M4 are provided on both the motor connector and on separate "
"pads, plus M5-6 on a separate pads for LED strip and camera control."
msgstr ""
"TBS LUCID PRO 最多支持 6 路 PWM 或 DShot 输出。电机输出 M1 至 M4 的焊盘同时提供在电机连接器和独立焊盘上，另有 "
"M5–6 的独立焊盘用于 LED 灯带和相机控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:72
#: d993b129906a4ef0a396905132f9113d
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:75
#: 9501856a171a4b88bd3f428efe041b50
msgid "PWM 1-2   in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1–2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:76
#: 397ceb85750149fd9c9b87cb60924189
msgid "PWM 3-4   in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3–4 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:77
#: b03a32efed414322a840d8ae54a09274
msgid "PWM 5-6   in group3 (No DShot). PWM5 marked as \"CAMC\", PWM6 as \"LED\""
msgstr "PWM 5–6 在第3组（不支持 DShot）。PWM5 标记为 「CAMC」，PWM6 标记为 「LED」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:79
#: 70bb58a3cfef4a36a13af72a7d133f1f
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-4 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。如果某组中的任意通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。通道1-4支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:84
#: 13782c72f05a4c50bf8b795b6eba3157
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:85
#: 22466b4d1f724bc58f4766172314aeb1
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor and external current sensor input. "
"The current sensor can read up to 130 Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up"
" to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "板载内置电压传感器和外部电流传感器输入。电流传感器最大可读取 130A。电压传感器最高支持 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:89
#: 315f271eac014193860fc372f6fd708b
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:91
#: 897db02c5126471b89d4644313fa83b6
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:92
#: 3a4b2df4a1994c79bfa5bf865b8b3af2
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:93
#: 3ca1b35c8d7f4c26ab7e274b50bc860f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:94
#: fe8139327644499ebff3f09180a9f29e
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 20"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 20"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:95
#: 538a71518dc942f79ee3accb25a0dc73
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 40"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:98
#: 8d8ee24e47d44455b03187ab8f08f1d4
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:99
#: 8af1d32ab7954fdb8952f615c86029c8
msgid ""
"The TBS LUCID PRO does not have a builtin compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "TBS LUCID PRO 没有内置罗盘，但您可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:102
#: 6fe3f20aa5ef475d92c1fd43c91764be
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:103
#: e066b24392694cf6840bbc359d160241
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled “TBS_LUCID_PRO”"
msgstr ""
"此飞控板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的标记为 「TBS_LUCID_PRO」 "
"的子目录中找到"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:106
#: 4e9c8a1bbe4b4de68c6651345ff52b1b
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:107
#: 3387e63f4a564c93917684ab3aa69797
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidpro.rst:111
#: a88053e0d3c346e68dd2e83ef5c740f6
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可以使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
